ACKNOWLEDGMENTS AND CONTRIBUTORS

===============================================================================

This project acknowledges the following individuals and organizations for their
contributions to the SPC Encryptor Pro software and the underlying SPC theory.

1. ORIGINAL THEORY
   Minvokin Grabiel Xavier (Mr.MR)
   - Creator and founder of the SPC (Super Planet Crypting) theory.
   - The philosophical, mathematical, and cryptographic foundation of this
     system was developed by Mr.MR.
   - The name "SAOYUT" and all SPC-related terminology are the intellectual
     property of Mr.MR and the SPC community.

2. ARCHITECTURE RESTORATION
   SGM (Simple Gray Modules)
   - System architecture analysis and restoration.
   - Reconstruction of the original SPC theory into a practical framework.

   KOT/CAT STUDIOS
   - System architecture analysis and restoration.
   - Reconstruction and optimization of core cryptographic workflows.

3. DEVELOPMENT AND IMPLEMENTATION
   Open Source Community Contributors
   - Web application implementation (Flask, HTML, CSS, JavaScript).
   - Vietnamese localization and internationalization.
   - UI/UX design and responsive development.

   AI-Assisted Development Tools
   - Supplementary code generation and optimization.
   - Debugging assistance and performance analysis.
   - Documentation drafting and review.
   - Note: All AI contributions were supervised and reviewed by human
     developers. All final decisions regarding architecture, security,
     and functionality were made by human contributors.

4. TESTING AND QUALITY ASSURANCE
   Testing Team Members
   - Real-world testing across multiple environments.
   - Bug detection and issue reporting.

   Quality Monitors
   - Error verification and validation oversight.
   - Critical bug identification and resolution tracking.
   - Special acknowledgment for identifying and resolving the S + B
     (Sharding + Hashing Chain) compatibility issue.

